<section id="config">
<h1>Configuring a site <a class="lsd-anchor" href="#config" aria-label="Link to this section">#</a></h1>
<blockquote>
<p>Settings live in <code>lsdocs.toml</code>, next to the <code>docs/</code> directory.</p>
</blockquote>
<div class="lsd-admonition" data-kind="note">
<p class="lsd-admonition-title">Note</p>
<p>Unknown keys are an error<sup class="lsd-footnote-ref"><a href="#fn-strict" id="fnref-strict">strict</a></sup>, so typos are caught early.</p>
</div>
<section id="options">
<h2>Options <a class="lsd-anchor" href="#options" aria-label="Link to this section">#</a></h2>
<div class="lsd-table">
<table>
<tr><th>Key</th><th style="text-align: center">Default</th><th>Meaning</th></tr>
<tr><td><code>build.source_dir</code></td><td style="text-align: center"><code>docs</code></td><td>Where pages are read from</td></tr>
<tr><td><code>build.output_dir</code></td><td style="text-align: center"><code>site</code></td><td>Where the site is written</td></tr>
</table>
</div>
</section>
<section id="plugins">
<h2>Plugins <a class="lsd-anchor" href="#plugins" aria-label="Link to this section">#</a></h2>
<lsd-copy><figure class="lsd-code" data-language="toml"><pre class="highlight"><code class="language-toml"><span class="hl-source hl-toml"><span class="hl-punctuation hl-definition hl-table hl-array hl-begin hl-toml">[[</span><span class="hl-meta hl-tag hl-table hl-array hl-toml"><span class="hl-entity hl-name hl-table hl-toml">plugins</span></span><span class="hl-punctuation hl-definition hl-table hl-array hl-end hl-toml">]]</span>
<span class="hl-meta hl-tag hl-key hl-toml"><span class="hl-entity hl-name hl-tag hl-toml">name</span></span> <span class="hl-punctuation hl-definition hl-key-value hl-toml">=</span> <span class="hl-string hl-quoted hl-double hl-basic hl-toml"><span class="hl-punctuation hl-definition hl-string hl-begin hl-toml">&quot;</span>markdown<span class="hl-punctuation hl-definition hl-string hl-end hl-toml">&quot;</span></span>
<span class="hl-meta hl-tag hl-key hl-toml"><span class="hl-entity hl-name hl-tag hl-toml">builtin</span></span> <span class="hl-punctuation hl-definition hl-key-value hl-toml">=</span> <span class="hl-string hl-quoted hl-double hl-basic hl-toml"><span class="hl-punctuation hl-definition hl-string hl-begin hl-toml">&quot;</span>parser-markdown<span class="hl-punctuation hl-definition hl-string hl-end hl-toml">&quot;</span></span>
</span></code></pre></figure></lsd-copy>
<details>
<summary>Raw HTML passes through</summary>
<p>Content inside is still Markdown.</p>
</details>
<p>Escaping works: 1 &lt; 2 &amp;&amp; &quot;quotes&quot; stay safe.</p>
<div class="lsd-footnotes" role="doc-endnotes">
<div class="lsd-footnote" id="fn-strict">
<p class="lsd-footnote-label"><a href="#fnref-strict">strict</a></p>
<p>Plugin settings are the plugins&#39; own files, under <code>.config/</code>.</p>
</div>
</div>
